    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/1/91090.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 3,
    "turn_text": "Congressman, we should mention to our viewers that we are taping this on Friday, so a lot could change between now and many people watch this program on a Sunday morning. But I want to start with this. On Thursday evening, Senate Republicans unveiled a package that would provide hundreds of billions of dollars in loans to companies, big and small, corporate tax cuts in checks of up to $1,200, depending on what somebody makes, two taxpayers. Will you sign off on this relief package if it gets to the house?",
